message: If you use asof-bench, please cite it as below.
title: "asof-bench: what did a project decide, as of date D?"
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Saket
    given-names: Srijan
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/srijansk/asof-bench
url: https://github.com/srijansk/asof-bench
abstract: A pre-registered benchmark that asks what a project had decided as of a given date, with gold taken from the git history of the PEP, EIP and ERC decision records. Two licences apply. The dataset, the files in data/v0.1, and the published results are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (LICENSE-DATA in the repository, the licence named above); the code that generates and scores it, and the documents, are released under the MIT licence (LICENSE in the repository).
keywords: [benchmark, temporal, agent-memory, knowledge-graphs, evaluation]
